spice
* SPICE Netlist for the given circuit
R1 3 4 R1_value
R2 7 5 R2_value
L1 6 3 L_value

* Define net connections
* Node 6 is common between L and the upper node
* Node 7 connects R2 to the upper node
* Node 3 connects L to R1
* Node 4 connects R1 to the lower node
* Node 5 connects R2 to the lower node
* Node 22 is the output node